  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Suresh Kumar @ Anjani Kumar vs The State Of Bihar on 16 January, 2012 In The High Court Of Judicature At Patna Criminal Miscellaneous No.1260 of 2012 Suresh Kumar @ Anjani Kumar Versus The State Of Bihar For the petitioner: Mr. N.K. Agrawal, Sr. Advocate and Mr. Sanjiv Sharan, Advocate. For the State : Mr. Madhura Nand Jha, A.P.P. 2. 16.01.2012 .",
    "facts": "The petitioner is apprehending his arrest in a case registered under Sections 272, 273 of the Indian Penal Code and 31, 52, 56, 57, 59, 63 and 64 of the Food Safety and Standard Act. Some sweets (Khowa Barbhi) were seized from shop of petitioner with accusation that he has no license under the Food Alternation Act. It is submitted by learned senior counsel for the petitioner that till date analysist report has not been received.",
